{
 "name": "Walk-up Apartments",
 "notes": "A four-level walk-up, 36 by 24 metres with the fire escape. Ground floor: the cafe and its kitchen to the west, the lobby with the stairs in the middle, the garage with the van and the storeroom to the east, and the side yard. A flat and its bedroom either side of the landing on each floor above (floors at 3 and 6 m), and the roof garden on top (9 m). The inside stairs switch back up the stairwell; the outdoor fire escape climbs the east side from the yard to the roof as a second way up, with doors from the red and yellow flats. X is east, Z is north, in metres; yaw is degrees clockwise from north; furniture 'y' is height above the room floor. Rooms marked outdoor have no ceiling and a garden or paved floor.",
